{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d41266a397ada819a8cfde585269bc0683f6be3c31122a14e5a8ce71b53be84c", "ja": "特殊機器でミキ達のアーマーの動作を封じた\nシホは、自分とエミリーがテンタクルスの\nスパイだと告白する。口論となり互いの信念\nをぶつけ合う中、突如機兵群の異常行動によ\nる砲撃を受け、エミリーの反応が消失する。", "zh": "特殊设备封锁了美希等人的装甲行动。  \n志保坦白自己和艾米莉是触手的间谍。  \n在两人争论不休、互相碰撞信念之际，突然遭到机兵群异常行动引发的炮击，艾米莉的反应消失了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "a7e2e79bcb69c4e249da1b40fa098ce0351530e9b0751cb3130bb2fc6bedaebf", "ja": "あ、あれ？　重い……？", "zh": "啊、咦？好重……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "5b8536585e8f0846464ca6be2d1f8daecf6ec41c86158c8aa86cf6cf8be530fc", "ja": "アーマーがシステムダウンしてる！？\n何をしたの！？　エミリー！！", "zh": "装甲系统宕机了！？\n你做了什么！？艾米莉！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "2a42916cc4bc10fd634021f1f67b8b618fe826c8abf49090bc2fd58f6067c2ea", "ja": "みなさんのアーマーの、自律思考AIと同期して……\n外部から光学動力を停止しました。ごめんなさい。", "zh": "我和大家的装甲的自主思考AI进行了同步……\n从外部停止了光学动力。对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "1a0217c3b1bd885ac306b8aa36a69d246904979dd0cc11b7b4b271a1c63bd2b9", "ja": "うそ！？　ブライト・サスペンドパルス……？\n研究段階で放棄したはずよ！？", "zh": "怎么会！？　闪光停滞脉冲……？\n明明在研究阶段就已经放弃了才对啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "c0ff42788b38f299399a73d537663c8cc41b44406ced715f07dba131713e7470", "ja": "ユンゲルス機関では。でもユニオンのアーマーを\n止めたい人はたくさんいるんです。私たちみたいに。", "zh": "在尤恩格尔斯机构是这样。不过，想让联盟的装甲停下来的人还有很多。就像我们一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "52688c1e5fc8eece8df48d363f751e78e1136b0bc1f70c43ba36f68a76935955", "ja": "イク？　イクはどうしたの？\n動かないよ？　気絶してるだけ？", "zh": "育？育怎么了？\n动不了？只是昏过去了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "143c3326e8bce076443398ca3b00db2e076807f27bc448960635a05df6246ab3", "ja": "イクちゃんは適合が深いので、意識がシステムと\n一緒に落ちて。命に別状はない……はずです……。", "zh": "小育的适配度很高，所以意识也和系统一起掉线了。应该……不会有生命危险……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "9cc5d248bcf6d17de02993dfec1179a19a53dd5e107e4391e8d585dbd1775f84", "ja": "二人とも、スパイだったってこと？　どこの？\nどうして……、いつから……！？", "zh": "你们两个都是间谍？是哪里的？为什么……从什么时候开始的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "2a4196f0178fad701ed5e33f3f5d8966fb2a7187574659be387e5c3588e8abce", "ja": "最初からです。私が兵学校に入ったのは、\n軍の内側に入りこむためでしたから。", "zh": "从一开始就是。我进入军事学校，\n是为了打入军队内部。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "6b27734124a4064ef82ce60d10985d840ec33af7de62ddd4b8b640f4bdbdb913", "ja": "そんな……！", "zh": "怎么会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "646c89823c5a204361408c991e685867ec86fc0f576b9f7531dd9093c8424e8d", "ja": "ユニオンはもう無理なんです！", "zh": "联合已经不行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "2f31a0d91b9f3eb51cfb06dcfecd84a2f9197578985a8259b6cbc455501d4a88", "ja": "機兵を作って、制御できなくて、世界にばらまいて！\nフロンティアの統治もできない！", "zh": "制造出机兵，却无法控制，还将它们散播到世界各处！\n连统治边境都做不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "e73229dd55e87375f1c266e2668f64c8604aa5543f6c0069f1752fb0008b6958", "ja": "それでも平和を取り繕うために、壊して壊して、\n壊し続けて！　こんな世界でいいわけないでしょう！", "zh": "可为了粉饰太平，就不断破坏、破坏，再继续破坏！这样的世界怎么可能会好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "3d9416bc4667a111679ede4b5141771fd064cd933d6d942f5d0b8123ff5df62b", "ja": "シホ……。", "zh": "志保……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "da653fe6c0e72483899938d05a5a8880461e94a907cff39447efe95f6e6109c6", "ja": "でもテンタクルスなら、機兵を制御できる。\n協働できる程度に、思念パルスと交信できてるんです。", "zh": "但是，如果是Tentacles，就能控制机兵。\n也就是说，已经能够和思念脉冲进行交流，达到协同合作的程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "a76fce5d3f28ed0298f40cf50b2fa79b245ff2eb9c9079e784ce70dd3a974ed2", "ja": "そうだったの……。たしかにテンタクルスは、うまく\n機兵を利用してる。でも、それで被害も増えてるのに？", "zh": "原来是这样……确实，テンタクルス很会\n利用机兵。可是这样一来，受害也在增加啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "b86a5a5e469532c88eec904b096c2e75eb062b612941258487a78b67c57e01e9", "ja": "それでも！　フロンティアが独立すれば、空に境界線が\nできるんです。それで戦いが終わるじゃないですか！", "zh": "即便如此！只要边疆独立，天空中就会出现边界线。这样一来，战争不就结束了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "1cc034e5239fa578b5bb66e8957a9fe5e998905ceadd0dd62a474397d0c3e7be", "ja": "もちろんテンタクルスも万能じゃない。理想なんて人の\n数だけある。でも人間の統治の限界がユニオンなら！", "zh": "当然，触手网络也不是万能的。理想这种东西，人数\n有多少就会有多少种。但如果说人类统治的极限就是联合体的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "aafff344e8b143b878c7aebeadac836cec02ccea356bcd01a18fe627e0d63fa2", "ja": "人が人を救えないなら、別の手段を選ぶべきです。\n……戦いを終わらせるために。そうでしょう？", "zh": "如果人无法拯救人类，就应该选择其他手段。\n……为了结束这场战斗。不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "b3598b78fd1e283c57f46a0ac1ddf45c13c1be46b598c297a1b0604fdad58ae4", "ja": "それは、そうだけど……。", "zh": "是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "12c8a3fb62b9a9b0b80e405013e09192b78e1a572be7262bcebf2c4f295aca5e", "ja": "……最後に一応、聞いてみます。\nサヨコさん、先輩。できれば一緒に……。", "zh": "……最后我姑且还是问一句。\n纱代子小姐，前辈。可以的话，希望能和我们一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "de959c54c90f1889413e4b39e10b4065f5fc075cb3b8afee159431a24ceec095", "ja": "終わらないよ。全部壊すまで、戦いは終わらない。\n機兵は機兵。制御なんか絶対できない。", "zh": "不会结束的。在把一切摧毁之前，战斗都不会结束。机兵就是机兵，绝对不可能控制得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "0216b8ad270db8b28bfbfa8634798fbe20d887234ef6f2f569d1e0878a7df410", "ja": "できると思ってるなら勘違いしてるだけ。\nできたらいいなって思ってるだけ。", "zh": "要是以为能做到，那只是误会而已。\n只是觉得要是能做到就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "9de59a11478331e28007c6abf54bafe6066fc83d9104109096ea0a84456577a1", "ja": "機兵に心なんてないし、ルールもない。\n勝手に動くように作られてる。", "zh": "机兵没有心，也没有规则。\n它们就是被制造成会擅自行动的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "553290e9a5417bc0afc3c18f67ce4675555a3930c94838547f4618c74e670252", "ja": "できるだけ人を殺すように、世界を壊すように。\nわざと勝手に動くように作られた、最悪の化け物。", "zh": "为了尽可能多地杀人，为了毁灭世界。\n被故意制造成会擅自行动的、最糟糕的怪物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "128f6062ecda4dc32ace11495be0b07e77535ce4c548a44c5fbb7347583f2bfa", "ja": "それが機兵なの。ミキにはわかるから。\n……見えるから。", "zh": "那就是机兵。美希很清楚。\n……因为美希看得到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "1786a0340dfcc4b1ebcf35cf8e32bee977083743ba1a3e868bef14bbdbc9c0d4", "ja": "……。その、化け物を……！\n誰が作ったと……っ！！", "zh": "……。那个、怪物……！\n你以为是谁做出来的啊……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "5a0c95303968f1bc4f0e89e44bb40d58725a7e7ab5a53b10464e6d17e6d066c8", "ja": "シホさん……。", "zh": "志保……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "2997b0dc3eb01e5b2033f98de02c8d87570376a71c2d74c6f2ec950ae656b7c6", "ja": "……人はたくさん間違えてきたし、\nこれからも正しくいられるとは限らないけど。", "zh": "……人类犯过很多错，\n今后也未必能一直做出正确的抉择，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "d9c2588a782cd7023b39e4c239357d8f70f4f4f510c3b82a81db04d3ad9264dc", "ja": "人を救いたいって思えるのは、人しかいないと思う。\nだから、シホ。……私たちは、一緒には行けない。", "zh": "我觉得，只有人类才会想要拯救他人。\n所以，志保……我们不能一起走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "bccda348f0b9d553ec6f4baa968d9fceab29cf13efe6fdcc7d5e3bdadb90f2ad", "ja": "……。そう、ですか。\n……まあ、そういうだろうと思ってました。", "zh": "……。这、样啊。\n……不过，我也料到你会这么说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "84a5f31345863b6b1260cb4a0ca6c3877b8c5e827b8a193200284e11b0483706", "ja": "もういいです。先輩。サヨコさん。\n……さようなら。", "zh": "够了。前辈。纱代子。\n……再见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "7a670c9f865ebbc1f4b7ee3b76e1928422ee46ce796d7cd2177044a66aaf493e", "ja": "ここで救援を待っててください。……でも、イクは\n連れていきます。お二人が信じない、未来のために。", "zh": "请在这里等救援。……但是，我会带育一起走。为了那个你们二位不相信的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1034_003mik", "source_sha256": "3dc1f7d61dac982f22a61a98d0da8944512f269adf46b6f280b177438a2f0062", "ja": "え？　どういうこと？\nイクをどうするの？", "zh": "诶？这是什么意思？\n你要对育做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1035_032emi", "source_sha256": "38f7d1184d9c2b8ee5a68748d4bb500bbe0c89f9fed09ebfcfb9b91d1f6f5aed", "ja": "……アーマーとの同期適性が高い子を、\nテンタクルスはずっと……探していました。", "zh": "……“触手”一直在寻找与装甲同步适性较高的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1036_032emi", "source_sha256": "38a3a19f368c492e78d4bc4b09ed59d470282f214e126428b818a47176d45880", "ja": "統治モデルの一部として並列で連結する、\n超深度思考型のニューラルネットワーク機体……。", "zh": "作为统治模型的一部分并行连接的、超深度思考型神经网络机体……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1037_032emi", "source_sha256": "4aa786e441993c95cf74f8b17c18e62506be0891e748a4f66f265144d9ec87ef", "ja": "適合できるのは、ユンゲルス機関が生み出した、\n思考AIとの同期適性が飛びぬけた子供達だけで……。", "zh": "能够适应的，只有那些孩子……他们是尤恩格尔斯机构培养出来的，与思考AI同步适性极其出众的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef49e96b0e4e539fc28cbf5e385e6a57fd97a538411c638f39faa1694d4e5fc5", "ja": "観察ターゲット27、『エクステンド・ブレイン』。\n……それが機関での、イクの呼び名です。", "zh": "观察目标27，《扩展大脑》。\n……这是育在机构里的称呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "11f99e38153050dc0373d6207f5190926e1a1f1051eafc0e04ab02139b9c109a", "ja": "統治モデルの一部に、適合……？　まさか！\nイクを統治モデルの触媒にする気なの！？", "zh": "适配统治模型的一部分……？怎么可能！\n你们是想让育成为统治模型的催化剂吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "0c96d413d1e7b64b71ff9b61af2b75a98d25182dfacbf020fa586fa7e6d19cca", "ja": "制御に必要なだけです！\n研究が進めば、そんな……そんなこと……！！", "zh": "只是控制所需而已！\n要是研究有进展，那种……那种事……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1041_003mik", "source_sha256": "ff9c61603cae97c92668c7f70372d317edcb5d1a28bd070e36c83d7a6e9cdaa6", "ja": "！　待って！\n何か……こっちに来る……！", "zh": "！等等！有什么……正往这边过来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1042_se", "source_sha256": "2ae6fcfde8404fa07e107c73c2e98d287bf4fcbcfdc517c2bbf46194597ebc18", "ja": "ビーッ！　ビーッ！　ビーッ！", "zh": "哔——！　哔——！　哔——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "f577d70422aa873517e7534f3e49a3fe3c6bf6319dbb8458cd5e743635a0b077", "ja": "エミリー？　どうしたの？", "zh": "艾米莉？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1044_032emi", "source_sha256": "205ae54a3f757bda92d6b1148232d80313b0e46a913ea3374410e0306f7b7601", "ja": "テンタクルス側のエマージェンシーです。\nえっと……、えっ。ええっ！？", "zh": "是Tentaculus那边的紧急情况。\n呃……咦。咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1045_032emi", "source_sha256": "ee9fc6c5dd0ad74c93d5a37f8167f4127c0616fe36000e5dc14885ee2ab487ac", "ja": "降下作戦中の機兵群、全機コントロールを離脱、転進！\nこちらに向かってきます。……制御が放棄されてます！", "zh": "下降作战中的机兵群，全机脱离控制，改变航向！正朝我们这边过来。……控制被放弃了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "b8485e5fa5100fcc227970305d86f48cadd2f69088e26647bf93845e7141dfe2", "ja": "なんですって？　……どうして！？\n原因は？　評議会はなんて！？", "zh": "你说什么？……为什么！？\n原因呢？评议会怎么说！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1047_032emi", "source_sha256": "e81a892babacaf3c001bfd1a065eca2869a28d2a173ffc413e712b1a45d73035", "ja": "情報ありません！　緊急退避命令だけが……あっ。\n接近反応多数！　波形、ヒュプノス！　機兵です！", "zh": "没有情报！只有紧急撤离命令……啊。\n\n检测到大量接近反应！波形是Hypnos！是机兵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1048_003mik", "source_sha256": "7d4ec395e7e32f46ef0f11a54d1eecfcf628c9397ce2d5ea40664d358cc4ef46", "ja": "シホ！　ミキのアーマーを戻して、パルスを止めて！\nあいつらが来るんでしょ？　だったらミキが壊すから！", "zh": "志保！把美希的装甲恢复，把脉冲停下来！\n那些家伙要来了，对吧？那就由美希来消灭他们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3d4a217590e5245fe1e814fb8e96fd6dedc3e8260b19f6a4b7902a917277a5f", "ja": "なっ……、バカなんですか！！\n1万機相手に、させるわけないでしょう！！", "zh": "什……你傻了吗！！  \n面对1万台机器，我怎么可能让你去做啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1050_032emi", "source_sha256": "1465b5ffe4f115ee365630140ee5160206c2c1a8ea1d645268b919da77427e47", "ja": "ブライト・サスペンドパルス、停止します！！", "zh": "明亮悬停脉冲，停止！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1051_se", "source_sha256": "b9dd4ec4d84276eb053561b6aaa3f67ea624a9f2889751721aa4e61a9f1e36d8", "ja": "キュィィィィィ……！", "zh": "咻——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "5c9a31fc317743fc0e83f4c72f98ab9b0447b7169dcf52b382e622734667df19", "ja": "エミリー！？　どうして！？", "zh": "艾米莉！？为什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1053_032emi", "source_sha256": "c8ca47b1cc292cf0291c2beb6b62c464eb28fae51b271987f510596db8020a36", "ja": "逃げてもらうのに動力は必要です！\nサヨコさん、イクちゃんを……お願いします。", "zh": "想让你们逃出去，就需要动力！\n纱代子小姐，育就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1054_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd4c3d2c408a996d791b7bd349ad7ea34cf37c10d408c1be0f42f2cebc5c2365", "ja": "なに言ってるの？　ここまで来て、そんなこと……\n許すわけないでしょう！　ダメ、二人は動かないで！！", "zh": "你在说什么？都到这一步了，还说这种话……\n我怎么可能允许！不行，你们两个别动！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1055_032emi", "source_sha256": "bb24613a13fc4942b79329fb962764459b4bd11d1f5d57b71ae7042408af466b", "ja": "……やめましょう、シホさん。こんなこと、ダメです。\n未来はみんなのためのもの……。", "zh": "……住手吧，志保。这种事是不行的。\n未来是属于大家的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1056_032emi", "source_sha256": "0e8404422258ddb3c76506abf2df327eb60977b32f785ba3de2238afea281bd9", "ja": "イクちゃんの未来も、作ってあげないと。\n犠牲になっていい子なんて、一人もいません。", "zh": "也必须为小育创造未来才行。\n没有任何一个孩子该成为牺牲品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1057_033sih", "source_sha256": "8db1022df07a95cccabb1a4efe7e5297d5f4f0775d206ecfb3d9141380e1f706", "ja": "ふざけないで！\n命令よ、今すぐパルスを再起動しなさい！　早く！！", "zh": "别胡闹了！\n这是命令，马上重新启动脉冲！快点！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1058_033sih", "source_sha256": "2be28f36988b6571633b2ebbec86f8298029f78d272a199e2a971540a131a654", "ja": "でないと……、私が、あなたを……！！", "zh": "不然的话……我就要对你……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1059_032emi", "source_sha256": "50d82881250f73fe3abd9df9a9c841a45d8283a97ac4e9b1d0ad5f046f06672b", "ja": "シホさんも、我慢しないでください。\nもっと……本当の気持ちに素直になっても、きっと……", "zh": "志保也别再忍耐了。就算更加……坦率地面对自己真正的心情，也一定会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1060_003mik", "source_sha256": "8dc02c797840323c6ea358c4779bdf82ffd0a2fa4eca6615257907b63a7a48bc", "ja": "伏せて！！！！", "zh": "趴下！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1061_se", "source_sha256": "a792355d8e9b684285590120c61cb20c120acb95a7f9f423e443d265f6f93b05", "ja": "ガガーーーーーーーーーーーン！！！！！！！", "zh": "嘎啊——————！！！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1063_027say", "source_sha256": "8dd3346c5f879ace257296a42de08a7e5be2f8a82b3e0eaa7daed46dc26ca5e5", "ja": "っ、ケホッ、ケホ！　今の……機兵の遠距離攻撃？\nもう射程内に来たの？", "zh": "呃、咳咳！刚才那是……机兵的远程攻击？已经进入射程了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1064_003mik", "source_sha256": "29f0a95bf6c025f651ea9f7c86b2678ce981d91512e9ccf66202594d2881ec9f", "ja": "まだ！　でも次が来る！　サヨコ、シホ、散開して！\nエミリー、イクをお願い！　エミ……っ、エミリー？", "zh": "还没有！但下一发要来了！纱代子、志保，散开！\n艾米莉，育就交给你了！艾米……っ，艾米莉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1065_003mik", "source_sha256": "9b61a939b02d5a281452574e56061ca0fe6c94b1dfb2b621f280e2d69b4f212a", "ja": "！？\nエミリー、どこ！？　エミリー！！　返事して！！", "zh": "！？\n艾米莉，你在哪！？艾米莉！！回答我！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1066_027say", "source_sha256": "9b77a1f30669e7725762a01c582c663f4bdc9b20fb3c1bc3d39b168075a55b3e", "ja": "あ……。機体反応、消失……生体信号、なし……。\nまさか……直撃……？", "zh": "啊……机体反应消失……没有生命体征……。\n难道说……是直接命中……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1067_033sih", "source_sha256": "187ceaf5123c41bb4baf45b6695e8127a50cfb1a7dceea17e6b3315f113645b2", "ja": "あ……、ああ……っ。", "zh": "啊……啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0363_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0363_story_04_1068_033sih", "source_sha256": "42c84c528eb943d99421f5e8d96e5898cf557610bf64dc4579e6584d581a544e", "ja": "ああああああああああああああああああっ！！！！！！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
